  "rationale": "The four set-val rules use translate() with a concept map lookup, but the source variable may be null causing FHIRException. Replacing translate with copy allows null/empty values to pass through without failure. The duplicate linkId validation errors (vf-dd93f75fef6cd503, vf-956818d83f305d06, vf-632faa88165a410f, vf-356284f8e2a038e7) require modifying parent rules outside authorized edit points and are not fixable with this patch.",
